This shader

```
// dxc /Tps_6_0 .\rawbuf.hlsl
// error: llvm::cast<X>() argument of incompatible type!

struct S {float A[3];};
RWStructuredBuffer<S> buf;

[RootSignature("UAV(u0)")]
float main() : SV_Target
{
    uint X;
    return buf[0].A[X];
}
```

Gives an error like
> error: llvm::cast<X>() argument of incompatible type!

But it should say something like "error: using uninitialized value to access structured buffer"
